WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:34.480
Today a hacker is perhaps the most interesting profession in IT.

2
00:00:34.480 --> 00:00:36.680
And probably every kid dreams of becoming a hacker.

3
00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:41.700
And before we start talking about how to become a hacker, you need to distinguish three kinds of hackers.

4
00:00:42.120 --> 00:00:46.060
Some hackers are white hat, that is, good hackers,

5
00:00:46.060 --> 00:00:48.660
there are black hat hackers, that is, bad ones,

6
00:00:48.660 --> 00:00:53.080
and there are grey hat hackers, who are actually something in between, they themselves don't know where they stand.

7
00:00:53.080 --> 00:00:58.440
But to truly become a hacker you need a lot of work, a lot of time invested,

8
00:00:58.440 --> 00:01:01.840
first of all you must be smart — but being smart isn't necessary,

9
00:01:01.840 --> 00:01:06.440
what you actually need is just hard work and a big investment of time.

10
00:01:06.600 --> 00:01:09.920
So let's see in a couple of steps how to become a hacker.

11
00:01:09.920 --> 00:01:12.900
The first thing you need is to come up with a cool hacker name. Why?

12
00:01:12.900 --> 00:01:14.820
Because then you look dangerous.

13
00:01:14.820 --> 00:01:19.660
And names like Reboot, Defrag or Frozen look very cool.

14
00:01:19.660 --> 00:01:22.520
You can see these names here. And they look very cool.

15
00:01:22.520 --> 00:01:27.140
What else you can notice in these names — one small letter, one capital

16
00:01:27.140 --> 00:01:30.800
also show that your hacker name, your hacking skills are phenomenal.

17
00:01:31.140 --> 00:01:37.900
Besides, the more letters you replace with digits, the smarter you are and the better hacker you are.

18
00:01:38.020 --> 00:01:41.360
The second thing you need is to install a system called Lumix.

19
00:01:41.360 --> 00:01:45.440
If you don't know what Lumix is, look up Lumix on the internet, but there's one precaution.

20
00:01:45.440 --> 00:01:50.540
Because this surfing and this operating system are monitored by various organizations like the FBI

21
00:01:50.540 --> 00:01:53.400
and other organizations like Mossad, and so on, and so on.

22
00:01:53.520 --> 00:01:56.300
That is, when you surf — be careful with this system.

23
00:01:56.300 --> 00:02:00.380
Why exactly a system called Lumix? Because it has preinstalled tools.

24
00:02:00.380 --> 00:02:04.860
That is, you have preinstalled tools like a terminal, which are needed for hacking,

25
00:02:04.860 --> 00:02:09.920
and with these tools you can hack any government and change any website,

26
00:02:09.920 --> 00:02:12.660
and also infiltrate the very underground of a hacker group.

27
00:02:12.920 --> 00:02:18.680
The next item to do — it's best to enroll in some hacker school, that is, a school for hackers.

28
00:02:18.800 --> 00:02:20.540
Is there such a thing in the Balkans?

29
00:02:20.540 --> 00:02:26.800
So, as you know, hackers are illegal, and hacker and hacking are associated with some unlawful activity.

30
00:02:26.800 --> 00:02:32.100
Probably this school must be illegal too, that is, it can't be shown to the world legally.

31
00:02:32.140 --> 00:02:34.480
So, do we have one? Of course we do.

32
00:02:34.480 --> 00:02:39.560
It's ITHS, and behind this HS actually hides high school, that is, a secondary school.

33
00:02:39.980 --> 00:02:41.140
But in fact that's not so.

34
00:02:41.140 --> 00:02:46.060
In ITHS, that is, IT hacking school, there's a group intended for hackers,

35
00:02:46.060 --> 00:02:50.680
where you'll acquire real hacker qualities, where there are teachers

36
00:02:50.680 --> 00:02:55.040
who will separately teach you to hack and to use the Lumix operating system.

37
00:02:55.040 --> 00:02:59.100
But this group is special and rare, and only a few people get into this group.

38
00:02:59.180 --> 00:03:03.420
That is, when you enroll in ITHS, that is, high school, that is, a secondary school for hackers,

39
00:03:03.420 --> 00:03:06.200
there's this small group, where the teachers recognize you

40
00:03:06.200 --> 00:03:09.260
and put you in this HS group, that is, the hacking school group.

41
00:03:09.480 --> 00:03:12.480
And in fact this HS isn't high school but hacking school,

42
00:03:12.480 --> 00:03:14.600
but you have to earn it with your knowledge, your work.

43
00:03:15.120 --> 00:03:18.060
So — ITHS, straight to hacking school.

44
00:03:18.060 --> 00:03:21.520
After you've enrolled in school and finished the school for hackers,

45
00:03:21.520 --> 00:03:24.760
and installed and studied the Lumix operating system,

46
00:03:24.760 --> 00:03:28.060
and come up with a cool name that will clear your path into some group,

47
00:03:28.060 --> 00:03:30.020
you actually need to find that group.

48
00:03:30.140 --> 00:03:34.780
There are various sites where you can find a group, and there are also sites that track attacks.

49
00:03:35.060 --> 00:03:38.440
That is, you need to see on the screen how these attacks are tracked and how many are going on.

50
00:03:38.440 --> 00:03:42.280
And do you see just one going on? No, of course, several attacks go on at the same time.

51
00:03:42.720 --> 00:03:46.800
That is, you need to create a group where everyone has some role,

52
00:03:46.800 --> 00:03:51.540
and together, all with combined forces, you'll be able to hack anything.

53
00:03:51.820 --> 00:03:53.400
That is, you need to find this hacker group.

54
00:03:53.480 --> 00:03:57.460
The next item you need is a hoodie, that is, a sweatshirt with a hood.

55
00:03:57.560 --> 00:04:00.400
Have you seen a hacker without a hood?

56
00:04:00.520 --> 00:04:02.300
That is, he covers his head. No, you haven't.

57
00:04:02.300 --> 00:04:06.640
That is, have you seen a hacker who, like, hacks with bare hands?

58
00:04:06.640 --> 00:04:09.760
No, you haven't, he wears those very hacking gloves.

59
00:04:09.840 --> 00:04:15.440
That is, to become a professional hacker, you must have a hoodie and those very hacker gloves.

60
00:04:15.500 --> 00:04:19.220
Now we've come to the characteristics you need to become a good hacker.

61
00:04:19.380 --> 00:04:21.140
So, first you need a monitor.

62
00:04:21.280 --> 00:04:24.780
And the more monitors, the better hacker you are and the more skills you have,

63
00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:30.080
that is, you can simultaneously hack several sites or anything at the same moment.

64
00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:37.320
So, rumor has it that the best hacker in the world, Cold Frozen, has as many as 20 monitors.

65
00:04:37.480 --> 00:04:40.360
So, I recommend you start with 2–3 monitors,

66
00:04:40.360 --> 00:04:42.540
but to begin with, if you're a newbie at hacking,

67
00:04:42.800 --> 00:04:45.880
you need one monitor, as big as possible, and then an upgrade.

68
00:04:46.080 --> 00:04:49.840
That is, one monitor is level-one hacking, then two monitors is level-two hacking,

69
00:04:50.060 --> 00:04:52.660
three monitors is level-three hacking, and so on and so on.

70
00:04:52.820 --> 00:04:56.180
The more monitors you have and the more monitors you work with,

71
00:04:56.180 --> 00:04:59.400
the higher your skill, that is, your hacking mastery.

72
00:04:59.400 --> 00:05:03.100
And so, you'll see, from time to time you'll upgrade and buy a monitor,

73
00:05:03.100 --> 00:05:05.500
and so your skills will improve.

74
00:05:05.560 --> 00:05:09.040
The next item — learn not to use the mouse,

75
00:05:09.040 --> 00:05:10.460
that is, only on the keyboard tap-tap-tap-tap-tap,

76
00:05:10.820 --> 00:05:12.240
and you hack anything. Why?

77
00:05:12.240 --> 00:05:14.520
Because if you use only the keyboard, it goes like this.

78
00:05:14.680 --> 00:05:19.420
If you need the mouse, you have to break off here, switch to the mouse, and then go back to hacking.

79
00:05:19.420 --> 00:05:21.220
And here you lose time, that is, you have idle running.

80
00:05:21.620 --> 00:05:25.520
That is, in movies you've seen them hack without a mouse, and in fact it's not a myth.

81
00:05:25.620 --> 00:05:27.380
Most say it's a myth, but it's not a myth.

82
00:05:27.800 --> 00:05:31.660
And this mouseless hacking is very successful and efficient, and you don't lose time.

83
00:05:32.180 --> 00:05:35.280
Use jargon, that is, learn to behave like a hacker,

84
00:05:35.280 --> 00:05:36.980
so that people recognize a hacker in you.

85
00:05:36.980 --> 00:05:39.680
First, you need to listen to hacker music.

86
00:05:39.680 --> 00:05:43.560
We said you need to use those gloves, hoodie, no mouse, only keyboard.

87
00:05:44.080 --> 00:05:47.620
But a very important item — listen to hacker music. Why?

88
00:05:47.900 --> 00:05:50.040
Because then this hacker music affects your brain

89
00:05:50.040 --> 00:05:53.940
and raises your efficiency and your hacking skill.

90
00:05:54.020 --> 00:05:58.100
Besides listening to hacker music, you need to learn to talk like a hacker.

91
00:05:58.260 --> 00:06:02.540
How? That is, as much LOL, WTF, OMG and so on, and so on, of this slang as possible.

92
00:06:02.540 --> 00:06:05.800
And that way you'll show people that you're truly a dangerous hacker.

93
00:06:05.920 --> 00:06:09.140
Hack, that is, study, in as little light as possible. Why?

94
00:06:09.420 --> 00:06:11.800
The more light... there, I have two lamps next to me,

95
00:06:11.800 --> 00:06:14.740
and it's too distracting for my attention, and sometimes I have to squint.

96
00:06:15.040 --> 00:06:18.840
You also need the monitor to have as low brightness as possible. What does that actually mean?

97
00:06:18.920 --> 00:06:22.540
This light won't distract your attention, you'll be maximally focused.

98
00:06:23.240 --> 00:06:27.380
And if a hacker walks into your room and sees there's no light, he'll understand it's about a real hacker.

99
00:06:27.380 --> 00:06:31.360
Now, what kind of hacker would you be if your computer looked nice?

100
00:06:31.500 --> 00:06:34.860
And also, what kind of hacker would you be if your desktop looked neat?

101
00:06:34.960 --> 00:06:38.680
That means you're a bad hacker, because then you can't work with multiple things.

102
00:06:39.040 --> 00:06:44.080
When the desktop looks so disgusting, that is, everything's crammed, and you know what you're doing —

103
00:06:44.300 --> 00:06:48.020
you actually give the impression of a very good and authoritative hacker.

104
00:06:48.520 --> 00:06:50.820
And you also need to be on the FBI's wanted list.

105
00:06:50.820 --> 00:06:55.460
I don't know how you'll manage that, but no hacker, let's say, good hacker,

106
00:06:55.460 --> 00:07:00.040
became one without having been in prison or on the FBI's wanted list.

107
00:07:00.040 --> 00:07:03.220
So you must go to prison or at least be on the FBI's wanted list.

108
00:07:03.340 --> 00:07:07.180
And one hacker hid from the FBI for three whole years and hacked from the darkness.

109
00:07:07.260 --> 00:07:09.620
So, folks, that's what you need to be a hacker.

110
00:07:09.720 --> 00:07:11.560
And we'll see you in one of the next videos. Bye!